00:54:16.380 --> 00:54:19.380
That's the third step.

1035
00:54:19.380 --> 00:54:21.380
Clamp it.

1036
00:54:21.380 --> 00:54:22.380
It's too obvious.

1037
00:54:22.380 --> 00:54:25.380
Cut it away from the broken device.

