1042
00:54:36.380 --> 00:54:38.380
You put it in the back here.

1043
00:54:38.380 --> 00:54:43.380
Stick that end of that tube under sterile water.

1044
00:54:43.380 --> 00:54:47.380
Now what are you going to do next?

