Cut, then submerge, then unclamp.

1070
00:55:52.380 --> 00:55:54.380
It's alphabetic cold.

1071
00:55:54.380 --> 00:55:56.380
Clamp, cut, submerge, unclamp.

1072
00:55:56.380 --> 00:55:59.380
Clamp, cut, submerge, unclamp.

1073
00:55:59.380 --> 00:56:02.380
That is your order.

1074
00:56:02.380 --> 00:56:06.380
