Order.

1083
00:56:19.380 --> 00:56:20.380
Right?

1084
00:56:20.380 --> 00:56:21.380
But what if they say this?

1085
00:56:21.380 --> 00:56:26.380
They ask you the exact same question with the exact same answers

1086
