1090
00:56:40.380 --> 00:56:42.380
Submergent under?

1091
00:56:42.380 --> 00:56:43.380
!

1092
00:56:43.380 --> 00:56:44.380
The tube under?

1093
00:56:44.380 --> 00:56:45.380
The end of the tube underwater.

1094
00:56:45.380 --> 00:56:50.380
