00:57:30.380 --> 00:57:32.380
Submerge.

1108
00:57:32.380 --> 00:57:34.380
So it's what?

1109
00:57:34.380 --> 00:57:35.380
Best.

1110
00:57:35.380 --> 00:57:37.380
Because what's the best answer?

1111
00:57:37.380 --> 00:57:43.380
The one that you would do if you could only do one.

1112
00:57:43.380 --> 00:57:46.380
What's the first one?

1113
00:57:46.380 --> 00:57:49.380
The one you do first.

1114
00:57:49.380 --> 00:57:52.380
And that may be the same and it may be different,

1115
